# Ship bar

Follow `WORKFLOW.md`: fresh `origin/main` -> topic branch -> tests -> PR -> required
CI and review closure -> guarded squash merge. Deploy only after the protected
backup gate passes. Finish by verifying the exact Pi SHA and status API.

Do not force-push, bypass protection, deploy a dirty checkout, or claim runtime
success from local tests alone.
